  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Bangla AI**\n\nI\'m initiating the development of Bangla AI, focusing on a production-ready web platform tailored for Bangladeshi users. Currently, I\'m at the crucial skill check stage, ensuring all prerequisites are met. I\'m operating in ultra mode, so I must read SKILL.md.\n\n\n**Refining Platform Design**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the frontend\'s distinctive design. Bengali typography is a must, and I\'m aiming for a sleek Gemini/ChatGPT-style interface, complete with dark/light themes and mobile responsiveness. The platform will leverage a variety of AI models including Gemini, with modular provider abstraction. I\'m investigating Cloud SQL setup, and thinking on the database schema.\n\n\n**Clarifying Database Selection**\n\nI\'m now clarifying the database selection, reviewing if a simple SQLite solution is viable or if the user mandates Cloud SQL. The instructions seem to require Cloud SQL if the user requests SQL or a relational database, which they did. However, I need to confirm the terms, and stop the conversation.\n\n\n"
