      description: "Ultra mode is active for this conversation. Defines the mandatory build, verify, critique and fix loop: plan acceptance checks, decouple and unit-test pure logic (via node:test), make the app testable, look at the running app in a real browser (via the computer-use skill), critique what you see against a checklist, fix the top defects, and verify again before finishing. Read this skill before your first code change in this conversation, and again only if its instructions are no longer in your context."
    }
