  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Confirming the Tests Pass**\n\nI can confirm that all seven unit tests have passed without any failures, and it only took 469ms! Now, I am moving on to designing and building the database, focusing on `src/db/database.ts`. I\'m starting with a fully typed store that implements the relational schema, and I\'ve already defined a `User` table. It\'s seeded with an admin user (`admin@bangla.ai`) and an active subscriber (`subscriber@bangla.ai`).\n\n\n**Defining the Database Schema**\n\nI\'ve defined the complete database schema now, including tables for `Subscription`, `Payment`, `Chat`, `Message`, `AiProvider`, `AiModel`, `UsageRecord`, and `SystemSettings`. The `AiProvider` table is seeded with Google\'s Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, and Groq. The `AiModel` table is populated with several models, like Gemini 2.5 Pro, GPT-4o, and Claude 3.5 Sonnet. I am also planning on file-backed persistence in `data/bangla_ai.json`, with auto-save and an initial deterministic seed. Finally, I\'ve decided on methods to create, retrieve, update, and delete different entities.\n\n\n**Implementing Core Functions**\n\nI\'ve been occupied implementing key database functions like adding messages to chats, listing and getting providers and models, updating providers and models, recording usage, and getting server-level statistics. The data access functions are all typed, to ensure data integrity. I am now working on the server-side authentication layer. I\'m focusing on secure password hashing, token generation and validation, and the middleware. I am going to build password reset functionality too.\n\n\n**Defining API Interactions**\n\nI\'m now focusing on API interactions and streaming completions. I will call a configured provider\'s API endpoint, or simulate responses if no key is set or the network is offline. I\'ll handle token deduction, validate subscription status (returning 403 Forbidden with Bengali errors for non-subscribed or expired users), and enforce usage limits, also returning 403 errors with Bengali messages.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_14688142495379423818"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import fs from \'node:fs\';\\nimport path from \'node:path\';\\nimport crypto from \'node:crypto\';\\nimport { PLANS, calculateExpiryDate } from \'../utils/billing.ts\';\\n\\nexport interface User {\\n  id: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  password_hash: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  phone: string;\\n  role: \'user\' | \'admin\';\\n  status: \'active\' | \'suspended\';\\n  usage_limit: number; // e.g. 50000 tokens\\n  current_usage: number;\\n  reset_token?: string | null;\\n  reset_token_expires_at?: string | null;\\n  created_at: string;\\n  updated_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Subscription {\\n  id: string;\\n  user_id: string;\\n  plan_id: \'monthly\' | \'yearly\';\\n  plan_name: string;\\n  amount: number;\\n  currency: \'BDT\';\\n  status: \'active\' | \'expired\' | \'cancelled\';\\n  started_at: string;\\n  expires_at: string;\\n  auto_renew: boolean;\\n  payment_method: string;\\n  trx_id: string;\\n  created_at: string;\\n  updated_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Payment {\\n  id: string;\\n  user_id: string;\\n  subscription_id?: string;\\n  amount: number;\\n  currency: \'BDT\';\\n  gateway: \'bkash\' | \'nagad\' | \'rocket\' | \'sslcommerz\';\\n  trx_id: string;\\n  sender_number: string;\\n  status: \'completed\' | \'pending\' | \'failed\';\\n  gateway_response?: string;\\n  created_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Chat {\\n  id: string;\\n  user_id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  model_id: string;\\n  pinned: boolean;\\n  created_at: string;\\n  updated_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Message {\\n  id: string;\\n  chat_id: string;\\n  role: \'user\' | \'assistant\' | \'system\';\\n  content: string;\\n  model_id: string;\\n  tokens_used: number;\\n  created_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AiProvider {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  slug: string; // \'gemini\' | \'openai\' | \'anthropic\' | \'deepseek\' | \'groq\'\\n  api_key: string;\\n  base_url?: string;\\n  is_active: boolean;\\n  created_at: string;\\n  updated_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AiModel {\\n  id: string;\\n  provider_id: string;\\n  model_name: string;\\n  display_name: string;\\n  description_bn: string;\\n  badge: \'super_fast\' | \'reasoning\' | \'coding\' | \'balanced\';\\n  is_enabled: boolean;\\n  is_default: boolean;\\n  context_window: number;\\n  max_output_tokens: number;\\n  sort_order: number;\\n  created_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface UsageRecord {\\n  id: string;\\n  user_id: string;\\n  chat_id?: string;\\n  model_id: string;\\n  prompt_tokens: number;\\n  completion_tokens: number;\\n  total_tokens: number;\\n  created_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SystemSettings {\\n  global_usage_limit: number;\\n  default_monthly_price: number;\\n  default_yearly_price: number;\\n  support_email: string;\\n  support_phone: string;\\n  announcement_bn?: string;\\n}\\n\\ninterface DatabaseData {\\n  users: User[];\\n  subscriptions: Subscription[];\\n  payments: Payment[];\\n  chats: Chat[];\\n  messages: Message[];\\n  ai_providers: AiProvider[];\\n  ai_models: AiModel[];\\n  usage_records: UsageRecord[];\\n  settings: SystemSettings;\\n}\\n\\n// Password hashing utility using scrypt\\nexport function hashPassword(password: string): string {\\n  const salt = \'bangla_ai_salt_2026\';\\n  return crypto.scryptSync(password, salt, 64).toString(\'hex\');\\n}\\n\\nexport function verifyPassword(password: string, hash: string): boolean {\\n  return hashPassword(password) === hash;\\n}\\n\\nclass Database {\\n  private dataFile: string;\\n  private data: DatabaseData;\\n\\n  constructor() {\\n    const dataDir = path.resolve(process.cwd(), \'data\');\\n    if (!fs.existsSync(dataDir)) {\\n      fs.mkdirSync(dataDir, { recursive: true });\\n    }\\n    this.dataFile = path.resolve(dataDir, \'bangla_ai.json\');\\n    this.data = this.loadOrSeed();\\n  }\\n\\n  private save(): void {\\n    try {\\n      fs.writeFileSync(this.dataFile, JSON.stringify(this.data, null, 2), \'utf-8\');\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      console.error(\'Failed to save database to disk:\', err);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private loadOrSeed(): DatabaseData {\\n    if (fs.existsSync(this.dataFile)) {\\n      try {\\n        const raw = fs.readFileSync(this.dataFile, \'utf-8\');\\n        return JSON.parse(raw);\\n      } catch (err) {\\n        console.warn(\'Corrupted database file, reseeding initial data:\', err);\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    return this.createSeedData();\\n  }\\n\\n  private createSeedData(): DatabaseData {\\n    const now = new Date().toISOString();\\n    const futureMonthly = calculateExpiryDate(\'monthly\').toISOString();\\n    const futureYearly = calculateExpiryDate(\'yearly\').toISOString();\\n\\n    const adminId = \'usr_admin_001\';\\n    const subscriberId = \'usr_sub_002\';\\n    const unpaidId = \'usr_unpaid_003\';\\n\\n    const users: User[] = [\\n      {\\n        id: adminId,\\n        email: \'admin@bangla.ai\',\\n        password_hash: hashPassword(\'AdminPassword123!\'),\\n        name: \'\340\246\270\340\247\201\340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\205\340\247\215\340\246\257\340\246\276\340\246\241\340\246\256\340\246\277\340\246\250 (Admin)\',\\n        phone: \'+8801711000000\',\\n        role: \'admin\',\\n        status: \'active\',\\n        usage_limit: 1000000,\\n        current_usage: 1240,\\n        created_at: now,\\n        updated_at: now\\n      },\\n      {\\n        id: subscriberId,\\n        email: \'subscriber@bangla.ai\',\\n        password_hash: hashPassword(\'UserPassword123!\'),\\n        name: \'\340\246\244\340\246\276\340\246\250\340\246\255\340\247\200\340\246\260 \340\246\206\340\246\271\340\246\256\340\247\207\340\246\246\',\\n        phone: \'+8801812345678\',\\n        role: \'user\',\\n        status: \'active\',\\n        usage_limit: 50000,\\n        current_usage: 4850,\\n        created_at: now,\\n        updated_at: now\\n      },\\n      {\\n        id: