  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Site Design**\n\nI\'m now focused on translating the website fully into English and implementing a premium, minimal design. The task is to replace all Bangla content with English and refresh the AI-like design with something more streamlined and user-friendly. I\'m prioritizing a clean, premium aesthetic.\n\n\n**Verifying Language & Pricing**\n\nI\'m now cross-referencing Bangla-specific pricing in BDT (\340\247\263) with English content. I\'m ensuring all user-facing text, like labels, headings, and legal pages, are completely translated into refined English. Specifically, I\'m working to adapt the `index.html` file and `billing.ts` to keep the BDT formatting, while implementing English plan names and features.\n\n\n**Implementing English Features**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in implementing English across the entire site. I\'m updating tests, seeding databases with English content, and translating all server and auth messages. The navigation bar will feature a sleek \"Bangla AI\" logo with a subtitle. Home and account pages will be premium and minimal, including pricing cards in BDT, an elegant about page, and a full privacy policy.\n\n\n"
