            lines {
              text: "            Bangla AI (\"we,\" \"our,\" or \"the Platform\") respects the privacy and confidentiality of your personal information. This Privacy Policy details the categories of data we gather, how that information is utilized, our safeguards for transit across third-party model inference endpoints, and your statutory rights under relevant data protection standards."
