            lines {
              text: "          <p>"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "            When you interact with models (Google Gemini, OpenAI GPT-4o, Anthropic Claude, DeepSeek R1), your prompt payload is transmitted over secure TLS 1.3 channels to provider inference clusters strictly for the purpose of generating real-time completions. In accordance with enterprise provider terms, individual conversational data transmitted through our API pipelines is not utilized to train public foundation models."
