  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reimagining Account Page**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `AccountPage.tsx` redesign. The goal is a minimalist, premium feel. I\'ve sketched out the key components: Profile Info, Subscription status, Plan details (start, expiry), and a Usage Progress Meter displaying token usage. I am thinking of a crisp, efficient layout.\n\n\n"
