  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Goal:** Build and refine **Bangla AI** (\340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\202\340\246\262\340\246\276 \340\246\217\340\246\206\340\246\207) \342\200\224 a multi-model AI aggregator web platform for the Bangladeshi market giving subscribers unified access to top foundation models (Google Gemini 2.5 Pro/Flash, OpenAI GPT-4o, Anthropic Claude 3.5 Sonnet, DeepSeek R1) through a single chat interface.\n   - **Pricing & Business Model:** Monthly plan: \340\247\2631,299 / month; Yearly plan: \340\247\2639,999 / year. Gate model chat to active subscribers while non-subscribers can register and browse public pages. Configurable per-user and global usage quotas. Local payment methods: bKash, Nagad, Rocket, Cards/SSLCommerz with TrxID verification.\n   - **User Shift in Turn 2:** Convert the entire application to clean, professional English (UI labels, pages, legal draft, error messages, seed data) and upgrade styling to a premium, minimalist design (Linear / Vercel aesthetic, Plus Jakarta Sans & Inter typography, clean monochromatic palette) while retaining the Bangladeshi pricing (\340\247\2631,299 / \340\247\2639,999) and local MFS payment gateways.\n   - **Target URLs & Ports:** Port 3000, Dev URL `https://ais-dev-viywiqxns7sqv4qvsjio2j-517651776127.asia-east1.run.app`, Shared URL `https://ais-pre-viywiqxns7sqv4qvsjio2j-517651776127.asia-east1.run.app`.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Files Created / Completely Updated to English & Minimalist Theme:**\n     - `/index.html`: Header updated with English metadata, OpenGraph tags, Google Fonts (`Plus Jakarta Sans` & `Inter`).\n     - `/src/index.css`: Typography set to `Plus Jakarta Sans` & `Inter`, subtle custom scrollbars, clean letter-spacing.\n     - `/src/types/index.ts`: Updated `AiModel` with `description_en` and complete data contracts.\n     - `/src/utils/billing.ts`: English plan names (`Monthly Plan`, `Yearly Plan`), English feature sets, clean BDT currency formatter (`formatBDT(amount)` -> `\340\247\2631,299`), subscription expiry math, and token estimator.\n     - `/src/utils/billing.test.ts`: 6 unit tests targeting English formatting, expiry calculations, token estimation, and plan pricing.\n     - `/src/db/schema.sql`: Full standard relational schema (Users, Subscriptions, Payments, Chats, Messages, Providers, Models, UsageRecords, Settings).\n     - `/src/db/database.ts`: Relational store with persistence in `data/bangla_ai.json`, password hashing via scrypt, seeded with English demo accounts:\n       - `admin@bangla.ai` / `AdminPassword123!` (Admin)\n       - `subscriber@bangla.ai` / `UserPassword123!` (Active Monthly Subscriber)\n       - `unpaid@bangla.ai` / `UserPassword123!` (Free User)\n     - `/src/server/auth.ts`: Token generation, HMAC SHA-256 verification, role middleware with English error responses.\n     - `/src/server/ai-service.ts`: English system prompt, streaming callback engine, contextual synthesis for fallback, token quota enforcement, and English access denial errors.\n     - `/server.ts`: Full-stack Express app running on port 3000 with Vite middleware, English endpoints (`/api/auth/*`, `/api/subscription/*`, `/api/chats/*`, `/api/chat/stream`, `/api/admin/*`).\n     - `/src/context/AuthContext.tsx`: English fallback errors, auth and billing modal triggers, light/dark theme.\n     - `/src/components/Navbar.tsx`: Minimalist Apple/Linear navbar with BAI Pro badge, English navigation, theme toggle, token counter.\n     - `/src/components/pages/HomePage.tsx`: Minimal hero, 4 curated foundation model cards, transparent pricing in BDT (\340\247\2631,299 & \340\247\2639,999), gateway badges, and FAQ.\n     - `/src/components/pages/AboutPage.tsx`: Minimal About Us page covering mission, foreign exchange challenges, architectural principles, and Dhaka headquarters.\n     - `/src/components/pages/PrivacyPolicyPage.tsx`: English draft policy covering data collection, AI provider transit, security, user rights, and prominent legal disclaimer callout.\n     - `/src/components/pages/AccountPage.tsx`: Minimalist user profile, active plan status, token progress bar, and payment history table.\n     - `/src/components/chat/ChatInterface.tsx`: Sleek chat interface with collapsible sidebar, thread search, rename, delete, dropdown model switcher with pills, code block formatting with copy button, and streaming token deduction.\n     - `/src/components/auth/AuthModal.tsx`: English Sign In / Sign Up modal with one-click demo credentials.\n     - `/src/components/billing/PaymentModal.tsx`: English checkout modal supporting bKash, Nagad, Rocket, Cards, with merchant number copy and instant test TrxID auto-fill.\n     - `/src/components/admin/AdminPanel.tsx`: English admin console with analytics, user management, quota overrides, subscription grant modal, and provider API key configuration.\n     - `/src/components/Footer.tsx`: Minimalist footer with platform links, governance links, and Dhaka address.\n     - `/README.md`: English documentation, architecture overview, setup and deployment instructions.\n   - **Verification Passed:**\n     - `npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/billing.test.ts`: Passed (6/6 tests passing, 0 failures).\n     - `compile_applet`: Build succeeded cleanly.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - Native ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`) is used; dynamic `require()` calls must be avoided in `server.ts` in favor of top-level ES imports.\n   - Headless Chromium font loading on external Google Fonts can stall `page.screenshot` with timeouts if not using `font-display=swap` or if the network hangs; `playwright-cli snapshot` is much faster, token-efficient, and provides full accessibility tree validation.\n   - Strict mode in Playwright selectors must distinguish between identical text in header and footer (e.g., `button:has-text(\"AI Workspace\")` vs footer button).\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - *Error 1:* Playwright screenshot timeout (`TimeoutError: Timeout 20000ms exceeded waiting for fonts to load...`).\n     *Fix:* Favor `playwright-cli snapshot` for rapid DOM verification and ensure `display=swap` is present on font link tags.\n   - *Error 2:* Playwright strict mode violation when locating `button:has-text(\"\340\246\217\340\246\206\340\246\207 \340\246\232\340\247\215\340\246\257\340\246\276\340\246\237\")` matching 2 elements (navbar button and footer button).\n     *Fix:* Target specific elements via distinct selectors like `nav button:has-text(...)` or contextual container locators.\n   - *Error 3:* Dynamic `require(\'./src/db/database.ts\')` inside ESM `server.ts`.\n     *Fix:* Replaced with top-level static imports `import { db, User, verifyPassword, hashPassword } from \'./src/db/database.ts\'`.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - The codebase has been fully converted to English with a minimalist, premium design.\n   - `data/bangla_ai.json` was deleted and will re-seed automatically with the updated English data on next server restart.\n   - Server dev script in `package.json` is `\"dev\": \"tsx server.ts\"` and start script is `\"start\": \"tsx server.ts\"`.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   - **Dev Server Restart:** Run `restart_dev_server` to boot the fresh server instance with the updated English code and re-seed `data/bangla_ai.json`.\n   - **Final Verification Round (Targeted):**\n     1. Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together to verify zero syntax/type errors.\n     2. Run `playwright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000` with `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`.\n     3. Take a `playwright-cli snapshot` of the English homepage to verify typography and layout.\n     4. Test Sign In with `\342\255\220 Subscriber` demo button, navigate to AI Workspace, and verify chat interface in English.\n     5. Test prompt submission to verify real-time streaming and token deduction.\n     6. Take a desktop screenshot (`playwright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r3-english-desktop.png`) to confirm visual aesthetic.\n   - Report concise completion overview to the user.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Never rename `name` in `metadata.json`.\n   - Keep port 3000 running Express + Vite middlewares.\n   - Never expose API keys to frontend; use server-side `/api/*` endpoints.\n   - Keep Bangladeshi pricing in BDT (`\340\247\2631,299` and `\340\247\2639,999`) and MFS payment methods (bKash, Nagad, Rocket) while all UI copy is in English.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_end: 154
    render_latest_checkpoint: true
    total_subagent_count: 0
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Here is the full initial file tree for the application:\n/.env.example\n/.gitignore\n/index.html\n/metadata.json\n/package.json\n/src/App.tsx\n/src/index.css\n/src/main.tsx\n/tsconfig.json\n/vite.config.ts\n\nThe following dependencies are installed:\n@google/genai: ^2.4.0\n@tailwindcss/vite: ^4.3.3\n@vitejs/plugin-react: ^6.1.1\ndotenv: ^17.2.3\nexpress: ^4.21.2\nlucide-react: ^0.546.0\nmotion: ^12.23.24\nreact: ^19.0.1\nreact-dom: ^19.0.1\nvite: ^8.3.0\n\nThe following devDependencies are installed:\n@types/express: ^4.17.21\n@types/node: ^22.14.0\n@types/react: ^19.3.0\n@types/react-dom: ^19.3.0\nautoprefixer: ^10.4.21\nesbuild: ^0.25.0\ntailwindcss: ^4.3.3\ntsx: ^4.21.0\ntypescript: ^7.0.2\n\nKey file contents:\n\n--- /.env.example ---\n```\n# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.\n# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.\nGEMINI_API_KEY=\"MY_GEMINI_API_KEY\"\n\n# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.\n# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.\nAPP_URL=\"MY_APP_URL\"\n\n```\n\n--- /index.html ---\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>My Google AI Studio App</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"An application built with Google AI Studio.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"My Google AI Studio App\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"An application built with Google AI Studio.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n    <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.tsx\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n\n\n```\n\n--- /metadata.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"requestFramePermissions\": [],\n  \"majorCapabilities\": [\"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\"]\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/App.tsx ---\n```typescript\n/**\n * @license\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n */\n\nexport default function App() {\n  return <div></div>;\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/index.css ---\n```css\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n```\n\n--- /src/main.tsx ---\n```typescript\nimport {createRoot} from \'react-dom/client\';\nimport App from \'./App.tsx\';\nimport \'./index.css\';\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\'root\')!).render(<App />);\n\n```\n\n--- /tsconfig.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"experimentalDecorators\": true,\n    \"useDefineForClassFields\": false,\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"types\": [\"vite/client\"],\n    \"lib\": [\n      \"ES2022\",\n      \"DOM\",\n      \"DOM.Iterable\"\n    ],\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"moduleDetection\": \"force\",\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\n        \"./*\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  },\n  \"exclude\": [\"dist\"]\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /vite.config.ts ---\n```typescript\nimport tailwindcss from \'@tailwindcss/vite\';\nimport react from \'@vitejs/plugin-react\';\nimport path from \'path\';\nimport {defineConfig} from \'vite\';\n\nexport default defineConfig(() => {\n  return {\n    plugins: [react(), tailwindcss()],\n    resolve: {\n      alias: {\n        \'@\': path.resolve(__dirname, \'.\'),\n      },\n    },\n    server: {\n      // HMR is disabled in AI Studio via DISABLE_HMR env var.\n      // Do not modify\342\200\224file watching is disabled to prevent flickering during agent edits.\n      hmr: process.env.DISABLE_HMR !== \'true\',\n      // Disable file watching when DISABLE_HMR is true to save CPU during agent edits.\n      watch: process.env.DISABLE_HMR === \'true\' ? null : {},\n    },\n  };\n});\n\n```"
    }
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Build a complete, production-ready web platform called **Bangla AI**: an AI aggregator for Bangladeshi users that gives subscribers access to top AI models through a single chat interface, with user accounts, subscriptions, chat history, and an admin panel. The entire user-facing text (UI labels, pages, messages, legal pages) should be in Bangla, with English as a secondary option where it aids clarity. Write everything for the Bangladeshi market: prices in Bangladeshi Taka (\340\247\263).\n\n**Business model and pricing**\n- Monthly plan: \340\247\2631,299\n- Yearly plan: \340\247\2639,999\n- Subscribers get an account and can run tasks with all top AI models from a chat box. Non-subscribers can view public pages and register, but cannot use the chat until subscribed.\n- Each user has a configurable usage limit, which the admin can set per user.\n\n**Core requirements**\n- **Model integration:** Connect to top AI models through their APIs (for example OpenAI, Anthropic, Google Gemini, and similar). Model providers and their API keys are managed by the admin. The chat lets the user select a model. Keep the provider layer modular so new models can be added without rewriting the chat logic. Never expose API keys to the frontend.\n- **Public pages:** Homepage, About Us, and Privacy Policy. The Privacy Policy should be written as a sensible draft covering data collection, use, storage, and user rights, with a note that it should be reviewed by a legal professional before launch.\n- **Authentication:** Login and registration pages, with secure password hashing, session or token handling, and password reset.\n- **User account page:** Profile information, current subscription status, plan and renewal date, and remaining usage.\n- **Chat page:** A chat interface with model selection, streaming responses, and persistent chat history per user (create, view, rename, delete conversations). Usage is deducted per request and enforced on the server.\n- **Subscriptions and payments:** Monthly and yearly plans, with subscription status gating access to the chat. Integrate a payment method suitable for Bangladesh (for example bKash, Nagad, SSLCommerz, or a card gateway), and handle activation, expiry, and renewal.\n- **Admin panel:** Manage users (view, search, suspend, delete), manage subscriptions (grant, extend, cancel), add and configure AI API providers and their keys and enabled models, and set usage limits per user and globally. Admin routes must be protected by role-based access control.\n\n**UI/UX direction**\nDesign the interface to feel familiar and clean, in the spirit of Google Gemini and ChatGPT: a minimal chat-centric layout with a collapsible sidebar for chat history, a centered input area, clear model selector, responsive design for mobile and desktop, light and dark themes, and smooth streaming text. Keep visual styling original; do not copy any brand\'s assets.\n\n**Technical expectations**\nChoose a sensible modern stack for a small-to-medium web application (a full-stack framework with a relational database is appropriate). Structure the code for maintainability, with environment-based configuration for secrets, input validation, rate limiting, and basic error handling. Include a database schema covering users, subscriptions, payments, chats, messages, AI providers, and usage records. Provide setup instructions and a short deployment note.\n\n**Deliverable**\nProduce the working codebase organized by folder, the database schema, the environment variable template, and setup and deployment instructions. Where a feature requires a third-party account (payment gateway or AI API keys), mark it clearly as a placeholder to be filled in by the owner."
    }
    captured_user_requests {
      text: "perfect but i want a complete english language site . make full webite in english and also change the ai like design to primium simple minimal deisgn . now your job is only change the design and theme and the replace all the bangla language to english primium wbesite"
    }
  }
