  - generic [ref=e49]:\n        - generic [ref=e50]:\n          - paragraph [ref=e51]: 4+ Models\n          - paragraph [ref=e52]: Gemini, GPT-4o, Claude, DeepSeek\n        - generic [ref=e53]:\n          - paragraph [ref=e54]: Zero Cards\n          - paragraph [ref=e55]: Direct bKash & Nagad checkout\n        - generic [ref=e56]:\n          - paragraph [ref=e57]: Streaming\n          - paragraph [ref=e58]: Real-time low-latency response\n        - generic [ref=e59]:\n          - paragraph [ref=e60]: 99.9%\n          - paragraph [ref=e61]: High availability uptime\n    - generic [ref=e62]:\n      - generic [ref=e63]:\n        - heading \"Curated Foundation Models\" [level=2] [ref=e64]\n        - paragraph [ref=e65]: Instead of managing multiple $20/month foreign subscriptions totaling over $80+ (\340\247\26310,000+), access them all under one unified subscription.\n      - generic [ref=e66]:\n        - generic [ref=e67]:\n          - generic [ref=e68]:\n            - generic [ref=e69]: Google\n            - heading \"Gemini 2.5 Pro & Flash\" [level=3] [ref=e75]\n            - paragraph [ref=e76]: Massive 1M+ token context window. Built for deep document research and ultra-rapid general assistance.\n          - generic [ref=e77]: Low Latency \342\200\242 High Context\n        - generic [ref=e78]:\n          - generic [ref=e79]:\n            - generic [ref=e80]: OpenAI\n            - heading \"GPT-4o (Omni)\" [level=3] [ref=e86]\n            - paragraph [ref=e87]: Industry-standard multimodal intelligence. Unmatched in creative writing, strategy formulation, and nuanced dialogue.\n          - generic [ref=e88]: Balanced \342\200\242 Versatile\n        - generic [ref=e89]:\n          - generic [ref=e90]:\n            - generic [ref=e91]: Anthropic\n            - heading \"Claude 3.5 Sonnet\" [level=3] [ref=e98]\n            - paragraph [ref=e99]: Preferred by software engineers. Superior code synthesis, complex refactoring, and natural prose styling.\n          - generic [ref=e100]: Coding \342\200\242 Analytical\n        - generic [ref=e101]:\n          - generic [ref=e102]:\n            - generic [ref=e103]: DeepSeek\n            - heading \"DeepSeek R1\" [level=3] [ref=e114]\n            - paragraph [ref=e115]: State-of-the-art chain-of-thought reasoning model for mathematics, algorithmic logic, and formal proofs.\n          - generic [ref=e116]: Reasoning \342\200\242 Logic proofs\n    - generic [ref=e117]:\n      - generic [ref=e118]:\n        - generic [ref=e119]: Predictable Pricing\n        - heading \"Simple, Transparent Plans\" [level=2] [ref=e120]\n        - paragraph [ref=e121]: Choose the subscription that matches your workflow. Cancel or upgrade anytime with instant MFS checkout.\n      - generic [ref=e122]:\n        - generic [ref=e123]:\n          - generic [ref=e124]:\n            - generic [ref=e125]:\n              - heading \"Monthly Plan\" [level=3] [ref=e126]\n              - generic [ref=e127]: Flexible\n            - paragraph [ref=e128]: Ideal for individuals getting started with AI\n            - generic [ref=e129]:\n              - generic [ref=e130]: \340\247\2631,299\n              - generic [ref=e131]: / month\n            - generic [ref=e132]:\n              - generic [ref=e133]: Full access to top AI models (Gemini 2.5, GPT-4o, Claude 3.5, DeepSeek)\n              - generic [ref=e137]: High-speed streaming responses with priority queuing\n              - generic [ref=e141]: 50,000 token quota per monthly billing cycle\n              - generic [ref=e145]: Persistent chat history & session management\n              - generic [ref=e149]: Instant local payment via bKash, Nagad, Rocket & Cards\n              - generic [ref=e153]: 24/7 technical customer support\n          - button \"Subscribe Monthly (\340\247\2631,299)\" [ref=e158]\n        - generic [ref=e159]:\n          - generic [ref=e160]: SAVE 36%\n          - generic [ref=e161]:\n            - heading \"Yearly Plan\" [level=3] [ref=e163]\n            - paragraph [ref=e164]: Best value for power users and teams\n            - generic [ref=e165]:\n              - generic [ref=e166]: \340\247\2639,999\n              - generic [ref=e167]: / year\n            - paragraph [ref=e168]: Equivalent to just \340\247\263833/month\n            - generic [ref=e169]:\n              - generic [ref=e170]: Everything in Monthly Plan included\n              - generic [ref=e174]: Save ~36% annually (only \340\247\263833/month equivalent)\n              - generic [ref=e178]: 750,000 token quota per annual billing cycle\n              - generic [ref=e182]: Early access to newly released foundation models\n              - generic [ref=e186]: Dedicated high-throughput VIP server allocation\n              - generic [ref=e190]: Priority concierge & enterprise-grade support\n          - button \"Subscribe Yearly (\340\247\2639,999)\" [ref=e195]\n    - generic [ref=e197]:\n      - generic [ref=e198]: \"Trusted Bangladesh payment gateways supported:\"\n      - generic [ref=e203]:\n        - generic [ref=e204]: bKash\n        - generic [ref=e205]: Nagad\n        - generic [ref=e206]: Rocket\n        - generic [ref=e207]: Cards\n    - generic [ref=e208]:\n      - heading \"Frequently Asked Questions\" [level=2] [ref=e210]\n      - generic [ref=e211]:\n        - generic [ref=e212]:\n          - heading \"Can I switch between Gemini, GPT-4o, and Claude within the same conversation?\" [level=4] [ref=e213]\n          - paragraph [ref=e214]: Yes. You can toggle your preferred foundation model anytime using the top model selector. Your session context remains preserved.\n        - generic [ref=e215]:\n          - heading \"How quickly is my account activated after bKash or Nagad payment?\" [level=4] [ref=e216]\n          - paragraph [ref=e217]: Activation is instantaneous upon submitting your Transaction ID (TrxID) in the checkout modal.\n        - generic [ref=e218]:\n          - heading \"What happens if I exhaust my monthly token limit?\" 