odates thousands of standard queries. If you require higher throughput, limits can be customized by contacting support or through plan renewal.\n  - contentinfo [ref=e221]:\n    - generic [ref=e222]:\n      - generic [ref=e223]:\n        - generic [ref=e224]:\n          - generic [ref=e225]:\n            - generic [ref=e226]: B\n            - generic [ref=e227]: Bangla AI\n          - paragraph [ref=e228]: Unified multi-model AI infrastructure platform. Bringing world-class foundation models to Bangladesh with frictionless local billing.\n          - generic [ref=e229]: TLS 1.3 Encrypted \342\200\242 Verified Gateways\n        - generic [ref=e234]:\n          - heading \"Platform\" [level=4] [ref=e235]\n          - list [ref=e236]:\n            - listitem [ref=e237]:\n              - button \"Overview\" [ref=e238]\n            - listitem [ref=e239]:\n              - button \"Subscription Plans (\340\247\2631,299)\" [ref=e240]\n            - listitem [ref=e241]:\n              - button \"AI Workspace\" [ref=e242]\n            - listitem [ref=e243]:\n              - button \"Account & Billing\" [ref=e244]\n        - generic [ref=e245]:\n          - heading \"Governance\" [level=4] [ref=e246]\n          - list [ref=e247]:\n            - listitem [ref=e248]:\n              - button \"About Us\" [ref=e249]\n            - listitem [ref=e250]:\n              - button \"Privacy Policy\" [ref=e251]\n            - listitem [ref=e252]: Terms of Service\n            - listitem [ref=e253]: Security Practices\n        - generic [ref=e254]:\n          - heading \"Headquarters\" [level=4] [ref=e255]\n          - list [ref=e256]:\n            - listitem [ref=e257]: Level 7, Banani Commercial Area\n            - listitem [ref=e258]: Dhaka-1213, Bangladesh\n            - listitem [ref=e259]: support@bangla.ai\n            - listitem [ref=e260]: +880 9612-000000\n      - generic [ref=e261]:\n        - paragraph [ref=e262]: \302\251 2026 Bangla AI. All rights reserved.\n        - paragr