      full: "### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.locator(\'button[aria-label=\\\'Send message\\\'], button:has-text(\\\'Send message\\\')\').click();```### Page- Page URL: http://localhost:3000/- Page Title: Bangla AI - Premium Multi-Model AI Hub### Snapshot- [Snapshot](.playwright-cli/page-2026-11-11T22-55-53-039Z.yml)\n\n### Latest snapshot (.playwright-cli/page-2026-11-11T22-55-53-039Z.yml)\n```yaml\n- generic [ref=e3]:\n  - banner [ref=e4]:\n    - generic [ref=e5]:\n      - button \"BAI Bangla AI PRO Unified AI Hub\" [ref=e7]:\n        - generic [ref=e8]: BAI\n        - generic [ref=e9]:\n          - generic [ref=e10]:\n            - generic [ref=e11]: Bangla AI\n            - generic [ref=e12]: PRO\n          - generic [ref=e13]: Unified AI Hub\n      - navigation [ref=e14]:\n        - button \"Overview\" [ref=e15]\n        - button \"Pricing & Plans\" [ref=e16]\n        - button \"About Us\" [ref=e17]\n        - button \"Privacy Policy\" [ref=e18]\n        - button \"AI Workspace\" [ref=e19]\n      - generic [ref=e26]:\n        - button \"Toggle theme\" [ref=e27]\n        - button \"T Tanvir\" [ref=e307]:\n          - generic [ref=e308]: T\n          - paragraph [ref=e310]: Tanvir\n  - generic [ref=e314]:\n    - complementary [ref=e315]:\n      - generic [ref=e316]:\n        - button \"New Chat\" [ref=e317]\n        - button \"Collapse sidebar\" [ref=e320]\n      - textbox \"Search conversations...\" [ref=e329]\n      - generic [ref=e331] [cursor=pointer]:\n        - generic [ref=e332]: E-commerce Launch & Growth Strategy\n        - generic [ref=e336]:\n          - button \"Rename conversation\" [ref=e337]\n          - button \"Delete conversation\" [ref=e340]\n      - generic [ref=e344]:\n        - generic [ref=e345]: \"Total Chats:\"\n        - generic [ref=e346]: \"1\"\n    - main [ref=e347]:\n      - generic [ref=e348]:\n        - button \"Gemini 2.5 Flash super_fast\" [ref=e351]:\n          - generic [ref=e355]: Gemini 2.5 Flash\n          - generic [ref=e356]: super_fast\n        - generic [ref=e359]:\n          - generic [ref=e360]: \"Tokens Remaining:\"\n          - generic [ref=e361]: 44,756\n      - generic [ref=e363]:\n        - paragraph [ref=e366]: What are the essential steps to launch a scalable e-commerce business in Bangladesh?\n        - generic [ref=e374]:\n          - paragraph [ref=e375]: \"Launching a successful, scalable e-commerce venture in Bangladesh requires a structured strategy across four core pillars:\"\n          - heading \"1. Legal & Regulatory Compliance\" [level=4] [ref=e377]\n          - generic [ref=e380]:\n            - strong [ref=e381]: \"Trade License:\"\n            - text: Obtain from your respective City Corporation or Union Parishad.\n          - generic [ref=e384]:\n            - strong [ref=e385]: \"e-TIN & BIN:\"\n            - text: Register for tax identification and VAT compliance with the NBR.\n          - generic [ref=e388]:\n            - strong [ref=e389]: \"DBID (Digital Business ID):\"\n            - text: Mandatory registration from the Ministry of Commerce.\n          - heading \"2. Payment Infrastructure\" [level=4] [ref=e391]\n          - generic [ref=e394]:\n            - strong [ref=e395]: \"Mobile Financial Services (MFS):\"\n            - text: Integrate direct merchant accounts with bKash and Nagad (covering >80% of digital transactions).\n          - generic [ref=e398]:\n            - strong [ref=e399]: \"Payment Gateway Aggregators:\"\n            - text: SSLCommerz or Shurjopay for Visa, Mastercard, and internet banking.\n          - heading \"3. Last-Mile Logistics & Fulfillment\" [level=4] [ref=e401]\n          - generic [ref=e402]: Partner with dependable courier networks such as Pathao Courier, Steadfast, or RedX with automated API tracking.\n          - generic [ref=e405]: Set up a clear Reverse Logistics & Return Management SOP.\n          - heading \"4. Digital Marketing & Customer Retention\" [level=4] [ref=e409]\n          - generic [ref=e410]: Run targeted Meta Ads with engaging video content and WhatsApp/Messenger chat conversion funnels.\n          - generic [ref=e413]: Offer reliable Cash on Delivery (COD) alongside frictionless MFS pre-payments.\n        - paragraph [ref=e429]: What are the key benefits of using Claude 3.5 Sonnet for code refactoring?\n        - generic [ref=e436]:\n          - generic [ref=e437]:\n            - paragraph [ref=e438]: \"*Model: Gemini2.5 Flash*(Ultra Fast)\"\n            - paragraph [ref=e440]: \"Hereis an elegant,production-readysolutionwith cleanarchitecturalpatternsand inputvalidation:\"\n          - generic [ref=e443]:\n            - generic [ref=e444]:\n              - generic [ref=e445]: typescript\n              - button \"Copy\" [ref=e446]\n            - code [ref=e452]: \"/** * Validatesand normalizesphone numbersfor Bangladeshitelecom networks(+8801...) */ exportinterfacePhoneValidationResult{ isValid:boolean; operator?:\'Grameenphone\'| \'Robi\'| \'Banglalink\'| \'Teletalk\'| \'Other\'; formatted?:string; error?: string; } exportfunctionnormalizeBDPhoneNumber(input:string):PhoneValidationResult{ // Stripwhitespace,hyphens,and parenthesis const sanitized= input.trim().replace(/[\\\\s\\\\-()]/g,\'\'); // Regexpattern matchingBangladeshitelecom numbers:+8801[3-9]xxxxxxxx const bdRegex= /^(?:\\\\+?88)?01([3-9])(\\\\d{8})$/; const match= sanitized.match(bdRegex); if (!match){ return { isValid:false, error: \'InvalidBangladeshiphone format.Example:017xxxxxxxxor +88017xxxxxxxx\' }; } const prefixDigit= match[1]; const operatorMap:Record<string,PhoneValidationResult[\'operator\']>= { \'7\': \'Grameenphone\', \'3\': \'Grameenphone\', \'8\': \'Robi\', \'9\': \'Banglalink\', \'4\': \'Banglalink\', \'5\': \'Teletalk\' }; const operator= operatorMap[prefixDigit]|| \'Other\'; const formatted= `+8801${prefixDigit}${match[2]}`; return { isValid:true, operator, formatted }; }\"\n          - generic [ref=e453]:\n            - paragraph [ref=e456]: \"###ArchitecturalHighlights:\"\n            - paragraph [ref=e457]:\n              - text: \"1.\"\n              - strong [ref=e458]: \"Sanitization:\"\n              - text: Removes formattingartifactsprior tovalidation.\n            - paragraph [ref=e459]:\n              - text: \"2.\"\n              - strong [ref=e460]: \"Type Safety:\"\n              - text: Full TypeScriptinterfacecontractfor reliablecaller integration.\n            - paragraph [ref=e461]:\n              - text: \"3.\"\n              - strong [ref=e462]: \"Standardization:\"\n              - text: Returns normalizedE.164-compatiblenumbers fordatabasestorage andSMS gatewaydelivery.\n      - generic [ref=e417]:\n        - generic [ref=e418]:\n          - textbox \"Message Gemini 2.5 Flash...\" [ref=e419]\n          - button \"Send message\" [disabled] [ref=e420]\n        - generic [ref=e424]:\n          - generic [ref=e425]: Enter to send \342\200\242 Shift+Enter for new line\n          - generic [ref=e426]: Gemini 2.5 Flash\n```\n"
    }
    command_line: "npx --yes playwright-cli click \"button[aria-label=\'Send message\'], button:has-text(\'Send message\')\""
