  planner_response {
    response: "### Bangla AI \342\200\224 Complete English Platform & Premium Minimal Design\n\nThe platform has been converted to English with a minimalist aesthetic, tailored for the Bangladeshi market with localized BDT pricing and MFS payment flows.\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built & Verified\n\n1. **Complete English Language Transition**\n   - **User Interface & Navigation:** All headings, buttons, microcopy, error states, and session status are in English.\n   - **Public Pages:** \n     - **Homepage:** Hero with dynamic stats, curated foundation model highlights, transparent pricing, and local gateway badges.\n     - **About Us:** Mission, cross-border payment context, architectural principles, and Dhaka headquarters.\n     - **Privacy Policy:** Draft legal policy covering data ingestion, third-party AI transit, encryption, user access rights, and legal disclaimer.\n   - **Billing & Plans:** Fully localized in Bangladeshi Taka:\n     - **Monthly Plan:** \340\247\2631,299 / month (50,000 token quota)\n     - **Yearly Plan:** \340\247\2639,999 / year (750,000 token quota \342\200\224 save 36%)\n   - **Seed Data & Messages:** All sample conversations, assistant responses, and user credentials use professional English.\n\n2. **Refined Premium & Minimalist Aesthetic**\n   - **Design Language:** Linear/Vercel-inspired monochromatic dark and light themes, subtle hairline borders, and generous breathing room.\n   - **Typography:** Dual-tier typography pairing *Plus Jakarta Sans* for headings and brand elements with *Inter* for legible reading and chat threads.\n   - **Chat Ergonomics:** Minimal floating input bar, syntax-highlighted code blocks with one-click copy, and collapsible navigation sidebar.\n\n3. **Core Features Verified Live**\n   - **Unified Multi-Model Workspace:** Real-time streaming responses across Google Gemini 2.5, OpenAI GPT-4o, Anthropic Claude 3.5 Sonnet, and DeepSeek R1.\n   - **Token Quota Enforcement:** Server-authoritative token calculation and deduction per request, reflected instantly in the top bar and user account dashboard.\n   - **Bangladeshi Payment Gateway Simulation:** Instant checkout via bKash, Nagad, Rocket, or Cards with instant TrxID activation.\n   - **Admin Console (RBAC):** Analytics dashboard, user governance, per-user token quota overrides, subscription granting, and server-isolated API key management.\n\n---\n\n### Demo Accounts for Instant Testing\n\n| Role | Email | Password | Status & Limits |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Subscriber** | `subscriber@bangla.ai` | `UserPassword123!` | Active Monthly Plan (\340\247\2631,299), 50k token quota |\n| **Admin** | `admin@bangla.ai` | `AdminPassword123!` | Super Admin, Admin Console access, 1M token quota |\n| **Free User** | `unpaid@bangla.ai` | `UserPassword123!` | Unsubscribed (can browse plans and test checkout) |"
    modified_response: "### Bangla AI \342\200\224 Complete English Platform & Premium Minimal Design\n\nThe platform has been converted to English with a minimalist aesthetic, tailored for the Bangladeshi market with localized BDT pricing and MFS payment flows.\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built & Verified\n\n1. **Complete English Language Transition**\n   - **User Interface & Navigation:** All headings, buttons, microcopy, error states, and session status are in English.\n   - **Public Pages:** \n     - **Homepage:** Hero with dynamic stats, curated foundation model highlights, transparent pricing, and local gateway badges.\n     - **About Us:** Mission, cross-border payment context, architectural principles, and Dhaka headquarters.\n     - **Privacy Policy:** Draft legal policy covering data ingestion, third-party AI transit, encryption, user access rights, and legal disclaimer.\n   - **Billing & Plans:** Fully localized in Bangladeshi Taka:\n     - **Monthly Plan:** \340\247\2631,299 / month (50,000 token quota)\n     - **Yearly Plan:** \340\247\2639,999 / year (750,000 token quota \342\200\224 save 36%)\n   - **Seed Data & Messages:** All sample conversations, assistant responses, and user credentials use professional English.\n\n2. **Refined Premium & Minimalist Aesthetic**\n   - **Design Language:** Linear/Vercel-inspired monochromatic dark and light themes, subtle hairline borders, and generous breathing room.\n   - **Typography:** Dual-tier typography pairing *Plus Jakarta Sans* for headings and brand elements with *Inter* for legible reading and chat threads.\n   - **Chat Ergonomics:** Minimal floating input bar, syntax-highlighted code blocks with one-click copy, and collapsible navigation sidebar.\n\n3. **Core Features Verified Live**\n   - **Unified Multi-Model Workspace:** Real-time streaming responses across Google Gemini 2.5, OpenAI GPT-4o, Anthropic Claude 3.5 Sonnet, and DeepSeek R1.\n   - **Token Quota Enforcement:** Server-authoritative token calculation and deduction per request, reflected instantly in the top bar and user account dashboard.\n   - **Bangladeshi Payment Gateway Simulation:** Instant checkout via bKash, Nagad, Rocket, or Cards with instant TrxID activation.\n   - **Admin Console (RBAC):** Analytics dashboard, user governance, per-user token quota overrides, subscription granting, and server-isolated API key management.\n\n---\n\n### Demo Accounts for Instant Testing\n\n| Role | Email | Password | Status & Limits |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Subscriber** | `subscriber@bangla.ai` | `UserPassword123!` | Active Monthly Plan (\340\247\2631,299), 50k token quota |\n| **Admin** | `admin@bangla.ai` | `AdminPassword123!` | Super Admin, Admin Console access, 1M token quota |\n| **Free User** | `unpaid@bangla.ai` | `UserPassword123!` | Unsubscribed (can browse plans and test checkout) |"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\217\003\n\214\003\001i\024}\023j\002XlW\265\202H\215\005l\352\346\260\177\rt\212\267\237\340w6k\274\224l\004\337\364X\tg 2#d\200\302\322\276\344\373\203\362\352$\314\247zb\265\371\322.8\001\177K\214\213\270DY\004,\330B\326\3713`\320V;\251\373\246\233\324\351\241\027\212\205\nF?\370I\331\004\221\300\361o_0\355\305G\022*\327\230\310:\361_\306\222M\232\\\246wZ\305\270:\320\203a7b\\\221\021\323\340\237\255\263\324\3209\230%H\215\023\b\227\363\323f\345\351\236ig~I\224\322\240p\353V\267\a\230Y\343\034\221o\264\274\3135\305PU\367\006\2333\250\376oS\'X\325v\262\035#\005\023\025c\237w\026\034\221\274V)\\\253|\342N\214;\225m\331!\242\215\201\2244e\374\313\223\301CW_|Hh\242Tb\310\357`\032\341i\321\325\2733G\217!K$4\337\026\215\333\215\223v;\vJ\275\r~[\351b\244\352\217^\354\005\ri\246f\230ZR\212(\231\302\272U%\211\262jYH\t\324\301\335\317\304\376\224~\317\b6\205b\000(\362\t\374\270\263\356\200`\261\264\036\227\300\033\363\036\257S\330\374\227\\\260\323R\321\200!\340\3177\336\372V\215Q\236I\273\240\301o\177\3439\222\251Y\v\211v\241\251\253\215\250W\243g\255\001-\2000\336b\276\254\324=\255\254\021r\216\333y\023\265\250,*\\\030\356;N"
