  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Implementation Strategy**\n\nI\'m now focused on the website\'s transition from a demo to a final, published version. Specifically, I\'m working on removing the current demo sign-in system and integrating Google sign-in using Firebase for both sign-up and sign-in. My goal is to get this ready for real user access before adding further functionalities.\n\n\n**Clarifying Google Sign-In**\n\nI\'m solidifying the details for the Google sign-in integration. The plan is to completely remove the demo sign-in and replace it with Firebase Auth via Google Sign-In. Both sign-up and sign-in will exclusively use Google Sign-In. I\'m focusing on the frontend setup, specifically on how Firebase authentication integrates with the application. I\'m creating `src/firebase.ts`, incorporating `initializeApp`, `getAuth`, `GoogleAuthProvider`, and other key functions.\n\n\n**Integrating Firebase Components**\n\nI\'m now integrating the Firebase components, working specifically on imports for `initializeApp`, `getAuth`, and `getFirestore`. I\'ve added `firebase-applet-config.json`, which is critical for initialization. My current focus is the backend, which will receive the Firebase ID token and user data from the client, verifying or creating a user in the database. I\'m prioritizing user authentication using the Google profile from the client\'s sign-in.\n\n\n**Defining Security & Structure**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the security and structure of the Firebase integration. I\'m focusing on defining `firebase-blueprint.json` and generating `firestore.rules`. I\'m verifying user records with Google names, emails, and avatars, giving new users a base role, and looking into a strategy for managing user tokens. I plan to deploy the rules via `rpc_action`, checking the app\'s use of Firestore for real-time data. I need to read the `firebase-integration-rpc` guidelines.\n\n\n**Structuring Data Blueprint**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining `firebase-blueprint.json` to outline the data structure in Firestore, specifically for the \"User\" and \"Chat\" entities. This includes specifying properties like `uid`, `email`, `displayName`, and `role` for users, and `userId`, `title`, and `createdAt` for chats, along with their respective types and requirements. My goal is to use this blueprint to manage user profiles and chat threads.\n\n\n**Implementing Security Rules**\n\nI\'m now implementing the `firestore.rules`. I\'ve defined rules for user access, specifying read/write permissions based on ownership or admin status. I\'ve also defined rules for chat access, allowing authenticated users to read and write to chats they own or when they are an admin. I\'ve created functions for `isSignedIn()`, `isOwner()`, and `isAdmin()`. I am now working on deploying these rules.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_14501752411087109337"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"{\\n  \\\"entities\\\": {\\n    \\\"User\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"User\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Registered user profile in Bangla AI\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"uid\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n        \\\"email\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n        \\\"displayName\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n        \\\"role\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"user\\\", \\\"admin\\\"] },\\n        \\\"createdAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"uid\\\", \\\"email\\\"]\\n    },\\n    \\\"Chat\\\": {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Chat\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"User conversation session\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"userId\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n        \\\"title\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" },\\n        \\\"createdAt\\\": { \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"userId\\\", \\\"title\\\"]\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"firestore\\\": {\\n    \\\"/users/{userId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": \\\"User\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"User profiles\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"/chats/{chatId}\\\": {\\n      \\\"schema\\\": \\\"Chat\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"User chat threads\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Intermediate representation schema for Firebase entities\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/firebase-blueprint.json\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating firebase-blueprint.json\", \"toolSummary\":\"Write firebase-blueprint.json\"}"
