 paragraph [ref=e52]: Gemini, GPT-4o, Claude, DeepSeek\n        - generic [ref=e53]:\n          - paragraph [ref=e54]: Zero Cards\n          - paragraph [ref=e55]: Direct bKash & Nagad checkout\n        - generic [ref=e56]:\n          - paragraph [ref=e57]: Streaming\n          - paragraph [ref=e58]: Real-time low-latency response\n        - generic [ref=e59]:\n          - paragraph [ref=e60]: 99.9%\n          - paragraph [ref=e61]: High availability uptime\n    - generic [ref=e62]:\n      - generic [ref=e63]:\n        - heading \"Curated Foundation Models\" [level=2] [ref=e64]\n        - paragraph [ref=e65]: Instead of managing multiple $20/month foreign subscriptions totaling over $80+ (\340\247\26310,000+), access them all under one unified subscription.\n      - generic [ref=e66]:\n        - generic [ref=e67]:\n          - generic [ref=e68]:\n            - generic [ref=e69]: Google\n            - heading \"Gemini 2.5 Pro & Flash\" [level=3] [ref=e75]\n            - paragraph [ref=e76]: Massive 1M+ token context window. Built for deep document research and ultra-rapid general assistance.\n          - generic [ref=e77]: Low Latency \342\200\242 High Context\n        - generic [ref=e78]:\n          - generic [ref=e79]:\n            - generic [ref=e80]: OpenAI\n            - heading \"GPT-4o (Omni)\" [level=3] [ref=e86]\n            - paragraph [ref=e87]: Industry-standard multimodal intelligence. Unmatched in creative writing, strategy formulation, and nuanced dialogue.\n          - generic [ref=e88]: Balanced \342\200\242 Versatile\n        - generic [ref=e89]:\n          - generic [ref=e90]:\n            - generic [ref=e91]: Anthropic\n            - heading \"Claude 3.5 Sonnet\" [level=3] [ref=e98]\n            - paragraph [ref=e99]: Preferred by software engineers. Superior code synthesis, complex refactoring, and natural prose styling.\n          - generic [ref=e100]: Coding \342\200\242 Analytical\n        - generic [ref=e101]:\n          - generic [ref=e102]: