        - generic [ref=e166]: \340\247\2639,999\n              - generic [ref=e167]: / year\n            - paragraph [ref=e168]: Equivalent to just \340\247\263833/month\n            - generic [ref=e169]:\n              - generic [ref=e170]: Everything in Monthly Plan included\n              - generic [ref=e174]: Save ~36% annually (only \340\247\263833/month equivalent)\n              - generic [ref=e178]: 750,000 token quota per annual billing cycle\n              - generic [ref=e182]: Early access to newly released foundation models\n              - generic [ref=e186]: Dedicated high-throughput VIP server allocation\n              - generic [ref=e190]: Priority concierge & enterprise-grade support\n          - button \"Subscribe Yearly (\340\247\2639,999)\" [ref=e195]\n    - generic [ref=e197]:\n      - generic [ref=e198]: \"Trusted Bangladesh payment gateways supported:\"\n      - generic [ref=e203]:\n        - generic [ref=e204]: bKash\n        - generic [ref=e205]: Nagad\n        - generic [ref=e206]: Rocket\n        - generic [ref=e207]: Cards\n    - generic [ref=e208]:\n      - heading \"Frequently Asked Questions\" [level=2] [ref=e210]\n      - generic [ref=e211]:\n        - generic [ref=e212]:\n          - heading \"Can I switch between Gemini, GPT-4o, and Claude within the same conversation?\" [level=4] [ref=e213]\n          - paragraph [ref=e214]: Yes. You can toggle your preferred foundation model anytime using the top model selector. Your session context remains preserved.\n        - generic [ref=e215]:\n          - heading \"How quickly is my account activated after bKash or Nagad payment?\" [level=4] [ref=e216]\n          - paragraph [ref=e217]: Activation is instantaneous upon submitting your Transaction ID (TrxID) in the checkout modal.\n        - generic [ref=e218]:\n          - heading \"What happens if I exhaust my monthly token limit?\" [level=4] [ref=e219]\n          - paragraph [ref=e220]: The 50,000 token monthly quota accommodates thousands of standard queries. If you require higher throughput, limits can be customized by contacting support or through plan renewal.\n  - contentinfo [ref=e221]:\n    - generic [ref=e222]:\n      - generic [ref=e223]:\n        - generic [ref=e224]:\n          - generic [ref=e225]:\n            - generic [ref=e226]: B\n            - generic [ref=e227]: Bangla AI\n          - paragraph [ref=e228]: Unified multi-model AI infrastructure platform. Bringing world-class foundation models to Bangladesh with frictionless local billing.\n          - generic [ref=e229]: TLS 1.3 Encrypted \342\200\242 Verified Gateways\n        - generic [ref=e234]:\n          - heading \"Platform\" [level=4] [ref=e235]\n          - list [ref=e236]:\n            - listitem [ref=e237]:\n              - button \"Overview\" [ref=e238]\n            - listitem [ref=e239]:\n              - button \"Subscription Plans (\340\247\2631,299)\" [ref=e240]\n            - listitem [ref=e241]:\n              - button \"AI Workspace\" [ref=e242]\n            - listitem [ref=e243]:\n              - button \"Account & Billing\" [ref=e244]\n        - generic [ref=e245]:\n          - heading \"Governance\" [level=4] [ref=e246]\n          - list [ref=e247]:\n            - listitem [ref=e248]:\n              - button \"About Us\" [ref=e249]\n            - listitem [ref=e250]:\n              - button \"Privacy Policy\" [ref=e251]\n            - listitem [ref=e252]: Terms of Service\n            - listitem [ref=e253]: Security Practices\n        - generic [ref=e254]:\n          - heading \"Headquarters\" [level=4] [ref=e255]\n          - list [ref=e256]:\n            - listitem [ref=e257]: Level 7, Banani Commercial Area\n            - listitem [ref=e258]: Dhaka-1213, Bangladesh\n            - listitem [ref=e259]: support@bangla.ai\n            - listitem [ref=e260]: +880 9612-000000\n      - generic [ref=e261]:\n        - paragraph [ref=e262]: \302\251 2026 Bangla AI. All rights reserved.\n        - paragraph [ref=e263]: Engineered with minimalism and precision.\n  - dialog [ref=e265]:\n    - button \"Close\" [ref=e266]\n    - generic [ref=e270]:\n      - heading \"Get Started with Bangla AI\" [level=2] [ref=e296]\n      - paragraph [ref=e276]: Join Bangladesh\342\200\231s premier multi-model AI infrastructure platform in seconds\n      - generic [ref=e277]:\n        - button \"Sign In\" [ref=e278]\n        - button \"Sign Up\" [active] [ref=e279]\n    - generic [ref=e280]:\n      - button \"Sign up with Google\" [ref=e297] [cursor=pointer]\n      - generic [ref=e289]:\n        - generic [ref=e290]: Firebase Verified \342\200\242 Instant 1-Click Access\n        - paragraph [ref=e295]: By continuing, you agree to Bangla AI\342\200\231s Terms of Service and Privacy Policy. No password required.\n```\n"
