  planner_response {
    response: "### Firebase Google Authentication Integration & Demo System Removal\n\nThe application has been upgraded for production with **Firebase Authentication (Sign in with Google)**, and the previous demo sign-in accounts have been completely removed.\n\n---\n\n### What Changed & Was Verified\n\n1. **Removed Demo Sign-In System**\n   - Cleaned up demo account shortcuts (`\342\255\220 Subscriber`, `\360\237\221\221 Admin`, `\360\237\221\244 Free User`) and pre-filled credential helpers.\n   - Removed all hardcoded demo sign-in dependencies from the authentication modal and navigation flows.\n\n2. **Integrated Firebase Authentication (Google Sign-In)**\n   - Provisioned Firebase project (`passcode-504254`) with web application configuration and custom Firestore database initialization.\n   - Authored and deployed Firestore security rules (`firestore.rules`) with Attribute-Based Access Control (ABAC) and default-deny protection.\n   - Initialized the Firebase Web SDK (`src/firebase.ts`) utilizing `GoogleAuthProvider` and `signInWithPopup`.\n\n3. **Unified Sign In & Sign Up Experience**\n   - **Single-Click Onboarding:** Both **Sign In** and **Sign Up** now seamlessly route through **\"Sign in with Google\"** / **\"Sign up with Google\"** with real-time popup authentication.\n   - **Real User Profile Syncing:** When a user signs in with Google, their profile (`name`, `email`, `photoURL`, `uid`) is automatically synchronized to the application\'s user database via `POST /api/auth/google`.\n   - **Bootstrapped Admin Status:** Your account (`rakib504254@gmail.com`) is designated as the primary platform administrator with unlimited administrative rights and access to the Admin Console.\n   - **Avatar & Profile Support:** Google profile avatars and account details are displayed in the top navbar and user dashboard."
    modified_response: "### Firebase Google Authentication Integration & Demo System Removal\n\nThe application has been upgraded for production with **Firebase Authentication (Sign in with Google)**, and the previous demo sign-in accounts have been completely removed.\n\n---\n\n### What Changed & Was Verified\n\n1. **Removed Demo Sign-In System**\n   - Cleaned up demo account shortcuts (`\342\255\220 Subscriber`, `\360\237\221\221 Admin`, `\360\237\221\244 Free User`) and pre-filled credential helpers.\n   - Removed all hardcoded demo sign-in dependencies from the authentication modal and navigation flows.\n\n2. **Integrated Firebase Authentication (Google Sign-In)**\n   - Provisioned Firebase project (`passcode-504254`) with web application configuration and custom Firestore database initialization.\n   - Authored and deployed Firestore security rules (`firestore.rules`) with Attribute-Based Access Control (ABAC) and default-deny protection.\n   - Initialized the Firebase Web SDK (`src/firebase.ts`) utilizing `GoogleAuthProvider` and `signInWithPopup`.\n\n3. **Unified Sign In & Sign Up Experience**\n   - **Single-Click Onboarding:** Both **Sign In** and **Sign Up** now seamlessly route through **\"Sign in with Google\"** / **\"Sign up with Google\"** with real-time popup authentication.\n   - **Real User Profile Syncing:** When a user signs in with Google, their profile (`name`, `email`, `photoURL`, `uid`) is automatically synchronized to the application\'s user database via `POST /api/auth/google`.\n   - **Bootstrapped Admin Status:** Your account (`rakib504254@gmail.com`) is designated as the primary platform administrator with unlimited administrative rights and access to the Admin Console.\n   - **Avatar & Profile Support:** Google profile avatars and account details are displayed in the top navbar and user dashboard."
